    "title": "New Full-Time Fire Station Enhances Emergency Response in Northeast Tipton County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andre Washington ,\n13 hours ago Great news for residents of Northeast Tipton County as Tipton County Station 42 is swiftly transforming into an operational, full-time county fire station. According to a recent social media update from the Tipton County Fire Department, the county maintenance staff is diligently converting an existing structure, ensuring that the essential features from walls to plumbing are being installed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
